  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Single origin, high quality, craft coffee that supports small farms around the globe.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>LIke many we&nbsp; share an appreciation for adventure, the outdoors, and sharing stories with family, friends, and acquaintances along the way.&nbsp; We source our beans from small farms around the world and roast in small quanitities in order to provide our customers with the freshest and highest quality coffee available.&nbsp; Because we work with smaller farms we change our origins and roasts every few months.&nbsp; We are seeking to join others in a like-minded community to enhance their own experiences.&nbsp; Today we start this journey like any other day &ndash; with a great cup of coffee!&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Let us know how we can support you.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>FEED THE SOUL</span></p>\r\n</div>",
